{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7cb601303b223f625e3464b87e8905b8b039d1bbb3a188fdac1989cc061e15bc", "ja": "（もうそろそろ39プロジェクトのオーディションが\n始まる。個性的な子達が集まるといいな）", "zh": "（39PROJECT的甄选差不多要开始了。\n希望来报名的人都有自己的特色。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "da3fc112a4d1d432a432b8848d6af3d9c528c4f9567d6930d48bb2ca85b0cb2a", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nお茶、いかがですか？", "zh": "辛苦你了，{$P$}，\n要不要来一杯茶呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "04d9fc02cbae26cf93280aaa7c3aeef53f80f61391ca4e33d46550fea1d4c3d0", "ja": "お、ありがとう雪歩。\nちょうどひと息入れようと思ってたところだったんだ。", "zh": "喔，谢谢你，雪步。\n我正好想休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "51dc026501837a0a8eeaf952dcccabd14096eace40943aae5d05ef5fe7851564", "ja": "えへへ、よかったです。\nそれじゃ、入ったばかりの新茶を淹れてきますね。", "zh": "嘿嘿，那就好。\n那我去泡刚买来的嫩芽茶哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f348c9f46b9176a960ae4befc7bf4fb24c72e648652a6c31888a60c1717dd1fb", "ja": "新茶は瑞々しいフレッシュな香りが魅力なんです。\nとっても優しくて、爽やかで……。", "zh": "嫩芽茶的魅力就在于水嫩、新鲜的香气。\n入口时顺喉又清爽……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "24c92559f6619c18840011a7de93db9fb6150a738338f153428b39630f9385b7", "ja": "フレッシュか……。新しいアイドルが入ってきたら、\n765プロもみずみずしくなりそうだな！", "zh": "新鲜呀……等新的偶像进来以后，\n765艺能应该也会气象一新呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "aa926443c225219407fc899574a6a2a4fd8956fdb32291a26223feb3291b9470", "ja": "あ……そ、そういえばそうですね。\n新しい人達が、入ってくるんですよね……。", "zh": "啊……这、这么说起来确实有这件事呢。\n有新人要加入我们对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "461304a1ed7295c98b312f68e75e056d7077d9a3f50ce168eaf69796fa764b28", "ja": "しかも39人も……ううっ。", "zh": "而且还多达39人……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "99f424fb0c2c80543760c0b323b1b0f05d6e582eaeb7df6925ef3426a611d473", "ja": "そう、雪歩も先輩になるんだ。\n先輩として、後輩の面倒も見てやってくれ。", "zh": "没错，雪步也要当前辈了。\n就麻烦你作为前辈，好好照顾新人啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "939326d0e1404d28b43652e36b090b82817e35ce7dc2e71a6e6f9f692c3d6428", "ja": "私が先輩に……新しい人達の面倒を……。", "zh": "我变成前辈……照顾新人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b1f4717ba657a751ff59d7e6a8327845f9d82825669ee6030f2dfa6c63977da8", "ja": "わ、わかりました。先輩として一生懸命、\nみんなの分のお茶を淹れますね！", "zh": "我、我明白了。我身为前辈，\n会努力泡出所有人要喝的茶的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "427efbb88b4580d4f4b921bd55b07460fbfdb3539daa2e572cc8c2e5f9cd6557", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて。\nもうちょっとこう先輩らしく……。", "zh": "啊，我不是这个意思。\n是要你再有一点前辈的风范……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "03ac3a31da81cf86096b1e2e9814fdce10d9e381312b9e9f1b731f430514bddd", "ja": "うう……そうですよね…… 。\nでも、ダメダメな私に先輩らしいことなんか……。", "zh": "呜呜……我想也是……\n不过，做事不行不行的我要怎么像个前辈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5abb58c39406f4250bb5293fa8a2983c80b9c5e340799e610a39aff5af63a65e", "ja": "今だって、{$P$}やみんなに、\nたくさん迷惑をかけてるのに、新しい人達まで……。", "zh": "就连现在，我也一直在给{$P$}\n和大家添麻烦，到时候连新人都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1f0ea61e7cedca1b54f2b7201a9bf9532251c49feb046855424284152cdc6ee2", "ja": "私、面倒をかける自信ならあるけど……。\n見ることなんて、できるのかな……？", "zh": "要让人照顾我是挺有自信的……\n我真的有办法照顾别人吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "dd35e960abf1508f1e361974ffc671d19cbe69ed0851cdcdcb3d092f5cc3e807", "ja": "雪歩……。", "zh": "雪步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_1016", "source_sha256": "55ea065f43ad2fec14a9ddba956d4def97467a8b71a7ac660a6a7f4907936429", "ja": "見守る", "zh": "静观其变", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c3aa789326234f8b873a9f5fa3b3cb939ee1f5f24c28759a8330da5eee5f0f59", "ja": "（雪歩は自問自答している。\nここは見守っておこう）", "zh": "（雪步在自问自答。\n我先静观其变吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_2002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "83914f8c6e49a7a70a611c88ae17401c230ab801ac24827b7bb68674ee94c8fe", "ja": "でも……私なんかよりも、新しく入ってくる人達の\n方が、ずっと不安ですよね？", "zh": "不过……比起我，新加入的偶像\n肯定要不安得多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_2003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b74a8f321b5122360585366c01aa9dba69cc2b5e59a2f3cdb4e54f566947a9ed", "ja": "初めてのことばかりだろうし、お仕事も慣れてなくて、\n戸惑うこともたくさんあると思いますし……。", "zh": "眼前所及都是没经历过的事，还没习惯工作内容以前，\n心中一定也会有不少疑惑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_2004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8feda4858f869eca4e5e3f9a3cf3465133037918515286656df75f63d2d02253", "ja": "私、不安な気持ちなら、\n誰よりも理解できる自信があります。だから、その……", "zh": "我有自信\n比任何人都还能体会不安的心情。所以，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "314d66f9b048cebabfdcc442307aa9f923cdafc977eb6f8de411d5013b407b8f", "ja": "ああ、それでいいんだ。\n雪歩なりのやり方で、後輩を支えてやってくれ。", "zh": "嗯，这样就行了。\n雪步就用自己的方式，支援后续的新人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_2006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ed12d070896a5af415fb7737b1a91a6815e04c865f01627b0b3c1ef2499cb399", "ja": "はいっ。私じゃ、あんまりたいしたことは\nできないかもしれませんけど……。", "zh": "好的！虽然我可能帮不上什么大忙，\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_2007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "05826e538f65c06307545b08e4d64bc58d460c1ed0128b0c453e734ee387b963", "ja": "{$P$}にしてもらったみたいに。\n私なりに、頑張ってみますね！", "zh": "我会效法{$P$}为我做的一切，\n用自己的方式努力看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "579cb48bf91a481e54f7090850aa6556c7e641f8ad784c7aa854f535fcf51b50", "ja": "（覚悟を決めた瞳で、力強く頷く雪歩……）", "zh": "（雪步露出坚定的眼神，肯定地点了头……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_001_2009_p", "source_sha256": "6527abf44895d7eca52480a95c777ef8594ac01f4c35506d3912eee9172666d8", "ja": "（不安を知ってるからこそ、きっと誰よりも後輩に\n寄り添って、一緒に成長していってくれるだろう）", "zh": "（正因为知晓不安的恐惧，她一定会是\n最贴近新人的前辈，伴着她们一同成长吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
